.TH UAT 1 2026-08-29 UAT "Usenet Archive Toolkit"
.SH NAME
uat-galaxy-web \- web server for browsing and searching a galaxy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I uat-galaxy-web
<config.ini>
.SH DESCRIPTION
This utility starts a local web server for browsing a galaxy (a collection
of archives, see
.BR \%uat-galaxy-util (1))
as a set of linked pages: a newsgroup listing, per-group paginated thread
lists, full threaded message views, and single-message permalinks.
Full-text search is available both within a single group and across the
whole galaxy, using each archive's embedded lexicon
(see
.BR \%uat-lexicon (1)),
so no extra indexing step is required beyond having built the galaxy.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR config.ini
Path to configuration file.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration file is in INI format with the following options:
.TP
.BR [server]\ bind
IP address to bind to (default: 127.0.0.1).
.TP
.BR [server]\ port
Port to listen on (default: 8120).
.TP
.BR [galaxy]\ path
Path to galaxy directory (default: news/galaxy).
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.ad l
.nh
.BR \%uat (1),
.BR \%uat-galaxy-util (1),
.BR \%uat-web (1)
